feedback-ui-consent-title = Send reports to the Kadakas team?
feedback-ui-consent-text = Reports help us fix bugs and add features. A report with text only holds: its kind, the title and the text that you or an agent wrote, the method and the error message of a failed call (file names and names in quotes are removed), the Kadakas version, your operating system, and the name of the program that wrote it. Pictures, model excerpts, recent calls and log lines are sent only after you have reviewed them, one report at a time. Paths, tokens and e-mail addresses are removed.
