feedback-ui-scrub-note-screenshot = Paths, tokens and e-mail addresses are removed from the text, but not from the screenshot. The screenshot shows your window as it is.
feedback-ui-review-options-note = The move and georeference options also hide coordinates and CRS values in the recent calls and log lines.
